{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（28日）下午5時許，警方接獲多宗報案，指荃灣大河道近鱟地坊一間餐廳發生火警。</p><p>消防到場後大約10分鐘將火救熄。</p><p>現場消息指，餐廳內所有職員及客人及時逃生，沒有傷亡。</p><p>據初步調查，懷疑涉及爐頭回火。</p><p>網上相片可見事發時大量濃煙冒出。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:41:47.557906+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:21:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:18:09.979611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:38:14.773790+00:00","content_hash":"7ffb9261366ba861bda02c04077679b402637cf601a40448bc8a709e4c380169","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}